{"id": "lem-subdivision-compatible-continuous-polyhedral-homology-comparison", "decision": "accept", "evidence": "Reviewed the inherited current edit. Relative simplex boundary injectivity identifies the identity map on cellular chains with signed subdivision; CW naturality, pair simplicial approximation, homotopy invariance, and the published common-linear-refinement lemma give continuous-map naturality and independence. The current text already contained the common-refinement citation when this worker resumed.", "sources_actually_read": ["items/lem-oriented-simplex-comparison-for-an-ordinary-homology-theory.md", "items/lem-finite-simplicial-approximation-for-homology-comparison.md", "items/lem-two-finite-linear-subdivisions-have-a-common-simplicial-refinement.md", "Allen Hatcher, Algebraic Topology, Theorem 2C.1 and proof, pp. 177–179, https://pi.math.cornell.edu/~hatcher/AT/ATch2.pdf"], "files_changed": [], "before_sha256": "52e7872aa7c91e4ebbc8a6aa68e92ca6eb409a612851f040d6e00eed7010971b", "current_sha256": "52e7872aa7c91e4ebbc8a6aa68e92ca6eb409a612851f040d6e00eed7010971b", "statement_changed": false, "before_statement_sha256": "be96cf0f247f175292c8e068cb679f39cba3e3ddcf93d74ea63f001049ad5e97", "current_statement_sha256": "be96cf0f247f175292c8e068cb679f39cba3e3ddcf93d74ea63f001049ad5e97", "impact_file": null, "unresolved": [], "checks": {"precheck": "pass (focused 12-item run)", "rendercheck": "pass (focused 12-item run)", "diffcheck": "pass (owned tracked files)", "independent_judge": "not_run"}, "inherited_current_revision": "Shard snapshot already matched current text; HEAD differs. Worker 09 reviewed and accepted it without editing.", "head_sha256": "1c3ef16b37295eaf61878cc68632cdc57060d82aca88280ecc0170f4947d317c"}
